(def not-page "(not value)\n\nReturns the opposite of a `bool`.\n\nIt emits `!value`.")
(def cond-page "(defrule cond)\n\nRuns the first clause whose test is true: `(cond (test body ...) ...)`.\n\nA last clause `(else body ...)` runs when no test is true. Without one, the\ncall returns unit.")
